    "regime_notes": "Positive over full sample and 2020-2025 (IC 0.048911, ICIR 0.142441), weaker but passing over 2027+ (IC 0.032992, ICIR 0.109494), and strongly positive in 2028+ (IC 0.118476, ICIR 0.439043). 2026+ alone was below the gate (IC 0.006330, ICIR 0.018359); uncertainty is material in the 15-instrument cross-section.",
